84
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,478
The weather's holding steady, right?

85
00:06:55,460 --> 00:07:00,520
Besides, there are fewer curse users
in Okinawa than there are in Tokyo.

86
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,588
Let's keep it a little
more serious, Satoru.

87
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:08,562
It's better if the time limit on the bounty
runs out while we're mid-flight, right?

88
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:12,797
Satoru, you haven't released your
technique since yesterday, have you?

89
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:16,998
You haven't slept either, and you
don't plan to sleep tonight, do you?

90
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:20,516
Are you sure we don't need
to go back to Jujutsu High?

91
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:23,737
It's not a problem.

92
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:26,960
Grinding to endgame in an
MMO is far more training.

93
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:31,460
And besides, you're here with me too.

94
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:41,206
Nanami, they said they're
staying another day.

95
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:43,166
You think something happened?

96
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,680
Thank you.

97
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:41,360
Thank you.

98
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,651
Very good work, everyone.

99
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,560
We're now inside Jujutsu High's barrier.

100
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,557
Boy, am I relieved to hear that?

101
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,240
Yeah, so am I!

102
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:50,760
Satoru, hmm?

103
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,741
You really worked hard this time.

104
00:09:56,900 --> 00:10:00,940
I never want to get stuck again
babysitting some kid! Huh?

105
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,720
No, impossible.

106
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,860
We're inside Jujutsu High's barrier.

107
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:19,500
Excuse me, but have we met before?

108
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:22,640
Yeah, we have, but don't worry about it.

109
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:25,587
I'm terrible at remembering
guys' names, too.

110
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:35,520
On a lark,

111
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:38,799
I once went to see the
little brat of the Gojo clan,

112
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,960
who'd been born with the Six-Eye.

113
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:06,300
Never before or after that had anyone
ever noticed me standing behind them,

114
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,540
which is why I wore him down.

115
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,840
Until his senses dulled.

116
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:27,490
Satoru!

117
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,060
Don't worry, I'm fine.

118
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:34,097
I didn't make it in time with my
technique, but it missed my vitals.

119
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:38,497
I then strengthened myself with cursed
energy so the blade couldn't be drawn out.

120
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:40,637
It felt like nothing more than passing a

121
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:43,517
safety pin through a big
hole in a knit sweater.

122
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,776
Seriously, I'm fine.

123
00:11:45,100 --> 00:11:46,920
You make sure Amanai is safe.

124
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:49,484
I'll deal with this guy myself.

125
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:52,560
Go, Suguru. Take her.

126
00:11:52,820 --> 00:11:54,938
Make sure you two get her to Tengen.

127
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,190
Satoru.

128
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,040
Just be careful.

129
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:05,380
Follow me!

130
00:12:06,180 --> 00:12:07,010
Right!

131
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:10,060
Alright, let's get this over with.

132
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:19,820
