blade he stabbed me with.

133
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:22,437
Where did that cursed spirit come from?

134
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,597
Too many unknowns!

135
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,597
Damn it.

136
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:28,557
The star plasma vessel is gone.

137
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:31,917
I had hoped to take you down
with that earlier attack,

138
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,697
