143
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,877
leading to several false goals.

144
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:51,136
I had a good laugh when those star
religious group men went to Okinawa.

145
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:54,538
It sucked that none of the
sorcerers around her died.

146
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:57,761
But if I hadn't set that
time limit on the bounty,

147
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:00,457
then chances are you
wouldn't have released?

148
