your technique until the very end.

149
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:03,840
Is that stuck?

150
00:13:09,540 --> 00:13:12,020
He's fast, and not just that.

151
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:15,277
I had a feeling there was
something off about him.

152
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,060
He has zero cursed energy.

153
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:21,120
He has a heavenly pact,
giving you physical prowess.

154
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:57,157
I can't imagine anyone who knows
my technique coming without a plan.

155
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:59,757
Is that cursed tool your
precious trump card?

156
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,840
I hate to disappoint, but
I won't let it get close.

157
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:20,793
Since he has no cursed energy,
I can't read his presence,

158
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:23,160
