inside that cursed spirit?

170
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,180
So you're using fly heads to hide.

171
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:23,300
No, I can't tell where he is.

172
00:15:23,620 --> 00:15:25,360
He's created a blind spot.

173
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,740
I should use blue again.

174
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,320
No, wait, he's after.

175
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:33,420
Mom and I!

176
00:15:39,780 --> 00:15:42,956
His intuition is keen enough
to sense me empty-handed.

177
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:46,057
But there's no way his six
eyes would overlook the

178
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:49,240
