from this cursed tool.

179
00:15:50,940 --> 00:15:51,770
However...

180
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,908
That finally got you to focus
on defense with your technique.

181
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,380
A special grace.

182
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:32,817
A great cursed tool.

183
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:34,440
Inverted Spear of Heaven.

184
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:38,360
Its effect is the forced release
of any active techniques.

185
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:40,090
Well, well.

186
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,900
I think I'm getting my edge back now.

187
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:28,080
Riko, this is as far as I go.

188
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:33,160
I wish you luck, Riko. Please be.

189
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:41,157
Girl, I love you.

190
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:44,080
I always have, and I always will.

191
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:47,817
I love you too.

192
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,400
I love you too.

